{"t":"Great Energy Beam","s":"great-energy-beam-80ff7","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Great_Energy_Beam_530188.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Great Energy Beam</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Great Energy Beam\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Energy_Beam_530188.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exevo gran vis lux</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span> Energy Damage</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">110</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Attack Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Attack_Cooldown_61cf3f.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Attack (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"secondarygroup\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Secondary Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Great Beams Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Beams_Cooldown_107855.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Great Beams (6 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">29</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">155</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Electrified Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_9e8d1e.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span> Shoots a powerful, 8 square long beam directly in front of the caster.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>The Energy Beam continues to be a favourite among sorcerers. For this reason, a lot of research has gone into the spell to make it even more effective. The Great Energy Beam was the result of these endeavours. It is very similar to the original spell in appearance and in the way it is used, but its effect has been greatly improved. Of course, better performance comes with a price: The mana cost of the Great Energy Beam spell is considerably higher than that of its lesser relative.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>With the Beam Mastery, it's capable of increasing its damage and reducing the cooldown of all spells.\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Great Energy Beam animation\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"352\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Energy_Beam_animation_aee138.gif\" width=\"96\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-spell-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>In the early days of Tibia, when only Antica existed, <a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">paladins</a> were also capable of casting this spell. Later it was changed and paladins could no longer learn it, but those who did before the change could still cast it. Since Update 10.55, the right vocation is required not only to learn a spell, but also to cast it.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The graphic of this spell was changed in the Winter Update 2007.</li></ul>\n<center>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Before\n</th>\n<th>After\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Great energy beam1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"320\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_energy_beam1_3cd57c.gif\" width=\"96\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Great energy beam1(after winter update 2007)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"352\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_energy_beam1_after_winter_update_2007_8bd8fb.gif\" width=\"96\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</center>\n<ul><li>It used to deal less damage than <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a>, but that changed when the Wheel of Destiny was implemented in an effort to make Beam Mastery more appealing.</li>\n<li>As announced on July 7, 2026, the patch reduced the base damage from 170 to 155.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Attack_Spells\">Attack Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Annihilation</li><li>Apprentice's Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a></li><li>Brutal Strike</li><li>Buzz</li><li>Chained Penance</li><li>Chill Out</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Curse\">Curse</a></li><li>Death Echo</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Strike\">Death Strike</a></li><li>Devastating Knockout</li><li>Divine Barrage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a></li><li>Divine Grenade</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Missile\">Divine Missile</a></li><li>Double Jab</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Electrify\">Electrify</a></li><li>Energy Beam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Envenom\">Envenom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Winter\">Eternal Winter</a></li><li>Ethereal Barrage</li><li>Ethereal Spear</li><li>Executioner's Throw</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fierce%20Berserk\">Fierce Berserk</a></li><li>Fire Wave</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flame%20Strike\">Flame Strike</a></li><li>Flurry of Blows</li><li>Forceful Uppercut</li><li>Forked Glacier</li><li>Forked Thorns</li><li>Front Sweep</li><li>Great Death Beam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fire%20Wave\">Great Fire Wave</a></li><li>Greater Flurry of Blows</li><li>Greater Tiger Clash</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Groundshaker\">Groundshaker</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hell%27s%20Core\">Hell's Core</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Flash\">Holy Flash</a></li><li>Ice Burst</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">Ice Strike</a></li><li>Ice Wave</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ignite\">Ignite</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Inflict%20Wound\">Inflict Wound</a></li><li>Lesser Ethereal Spear</li><li>Lesser Front Sweep</li><li>Lesser Mystic Repulse</li><li>Lightning</li><li>Mud Attack</li><li>Mystic Repulse</li><li>Physical Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rage%20of%20the%20Skies\">Rage of the Skies</a></li><li>Scorch</li><li>Shield Bash</li><li>Shield Slam</li><li>Spiritual Outburst</li><li>Strong Energy Strike</li><li>Strong Ethereal Spear</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Flame%20Strike\">Strong Flame Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ice%20Strike\">Strong Ice Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ice%20Wave\">Strong Ice Wave</a></li><li>Strong Terra Strike</li><li>Sweeping Takedown</li><li>Swift Jab</li><li>Terra Burst</li><li>Terra Strike</li><li>Terra Wave</li><li>Thousand Fist Blows</li><li>Tiger Clash</li><li>Ultimate Energy Strike</li><li>Ultimate Flame Strike</li><li>Ultimate Ice Strike</li><li>Ultimate Terra Strike</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Whirlwind%20Throw\">Whirlwind Throw</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wrath%20of%20Nature\">Wrath of Nature</a></li></ul></div><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Great_Beams_Spells\">Great Beams Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Great Death Beam</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["the-annihilator-quest"]}